  "categorias": "Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>M&aacute;s de treinta paradas componen la I Feria Artesanal, en la plaza de San Vicente y la calle Trinidad del barrio de la Morer&iacute;a, en Onda, que hoy finaliza sus fiestas. La Feria volver&aacute; a abrirse a las 16.30 horas.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/04/IMG_5831.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Adem&aacute;s hay tambi&eacute;n atracciones infantiles en las calles Recin to y Los naranjos, y comida de hermandad, tambi&eacute;n al final de la calle Recinto.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesanalmoreria/img_5804.jpg\" alt=\"img_5804\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesanalmoreria/img_5805.jpg\" alt=\"img_5805\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesanalmoreria/img_5806.jpg\" alt=\"img_5806\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesanalmoreria/img_5807.jpg\" alt=\"img_5807\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesanalmoreria/img_5808.jpg\" alt=\"img_5808\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesanalmoreria/img_5809.jpg\" alt=\"img_5809\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesanalmoreria/img_5810.jpg\" alt=\"img_5810\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesanalmoreria/img_5811.jpg\" alt=\"img_5811\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firaartesanalmoreria/img_5812.j